ke a bug, along with his sadistic, rapist sons and the rest of his loathsome regime. Hell, he even got a fair trial, and a happy ending at the end of a rope. <br /><br />Finally, when I used the word &quot;Smear&quot;, I was referring to your attacks on people&#39;s motives and character, not the war itself. And your attacks on Chris Kyle were just that - smears. <br /><br /> <br /><br /> <br />
