hose who bore arms: By Kyle&#39;s own admission, his ROEs authorized indiscriminate killing of Iraqi males.<br /><br /><i>Nor are they fighting for a free Iraq.</i><br /><br />Neither did the foreign invaders from the U.S. who killed and died so that Iraq could be ruled by a Sharia-compliant constitution. 
